WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:08.640
It it almost feels surreal that I am telling you&nbsp;
this today, because I think many of us at least&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.440
would like to believe that this is not the type of&nbsp;
thing that would be possible in the United States.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:19.360
But it is possible we would be naive to think it's&nbsp;
not possible. And that's why the FBI has started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.600
vetting the National Guard troops who are&nbsp;
in Washington, D.C., to protect the city,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.160
to protect the capital, to protect the White House&nbsp;
in advance of enduring Joe Biden's inauguration.&nbsp;

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.520
And the reason the FBI is vetting National Guard&nbsp;
troops is that there are fear of insider Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:47.760
loyalists who may even assist in or participate in&nbsp;
an attack tomorrow, Inauguration Day. I'm almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:53.840
at a loss for words, but this should not come as&nbsp;
a total surprise because two weeks ago I told you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:01.840
that Joe Biden's entire Secret Service team is&nbsp;
being replaced rather than the typical. Some Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.560
Secret Service people carry over and some people&nbsp;
retire and then they bring in some new people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:13.360
which would be the standard thing because of&nbsp;
concerns about Trump loyalists in Secret Service.&nbsp;

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:19.280
Joe Biden is getting an all new team, including&nbsp;
some agents from the Obama era that worked with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:25.280
Biden in his capacity as vice president, as well&nbsp;
as new agents not believed to be Trump loyalists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:31.280
So we knew that a couple of weeks ago. And now,&nbsp;
as you know, because of the Trump riots on January&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:36.640
6th, National Guard troops have been called to&nbsp;
Washington, D.C. and they've been patrolling the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.600
streets and street corners of Washington, D.C.&nbsp;
for a week now. If you look at images of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:47.840
it looks dystopian. It looks like things we&nbsp;
would imagine only happen in other countries, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:54.320
they're happening right here in the United States,&nbsp;
but it is not quite so simple. Defense officials&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.320 --> 00:02:02.000
and the FBI are worried about an insider attack or&nbsp;
threat from these very service members involved in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:09.600
securing Joe Biden's inauguration. And this has&nbsp;
led the FBI to start vetting all 25000 National&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:14.720
Guard troops coming to Washington, D.C., or&nbsp;
already in Washington, D.C. for this event.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:21.360
Now, imagine what it takes to vet 25000 troops&nbsp;
to figure out might this be a Trump loyalist?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:25.680
Has this person been visiting certain websites on&nbsp;
the Internet, coordinating with certain people on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:30.400
the Internet? And unfortunately, that degree of&nbsp;
vetting is not going to be possible. What it is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:36.800
what it is going to include is some more&nbsp;
automated processes for looking through folks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:43.200
maybe more detailed looks at people from certain&nbsp;
areas or people with certain characteristics.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.800
I don't even know how you vet twenty five&nbsp;
thousand people and they're expected to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:52.160
doing the vetting all the way up to tomorrow's&nbsp;
inauguration. And this is a situation where,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:57.680
I mean, listen, the FBI will run everybody's names&nbsp;
through databases. They'll see if any of the names&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:02.800
appear on watch lists already maintained to see&nbsp;
if there's something alarming that comes up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:08.960
If there have been names of the troops that&nbsp;
have been associated with prior investigations&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:14.000
or terrorism related concerns. But the&nbsp;
deep vetting that would be done, like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.240
for example, for people who will be close&nbsp;
to Joe Biden in a Secret Service capacity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:22.480
you just can't do that with twenty five thousand&nbsp;
National Guard troops coming to Washington,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:26.960
D.C. on relatively short notice. But the fact&nbsp;
that this is even being done is, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:34.240
horrifying and very, very scary. And I hate to&nbsp;
say this, I don't want to make this all negative.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:39.360
Because we are removing Trump, that's a good&nbsp;
thing and hopefully getting a fresh start on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.720
a lot of these issues that that we failed&nbsp;
on as a country over the last four years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.600
But this is an issue, radicalization&nbsp;
of law enforcement and military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:54.880
that's been studied for a long time. The Brennan&nbsp;
Center for Justice has a report called Hidden in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.880 --> 00:04:02.560
Plain Sight Racism, White Supremacy and Far Right&nbsp;
Militancy and Law Enforcement. Now, we've known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:08.560
for a long time that law enforcement tends to be&nbsp;
more conservative than the population at large.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.520
Law enforcement tends to vote quite a bit&nbsp;
more for Republicans rather than Democrats.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:19.760
The military is not historically made up of at&nbsp;
the sort of lower levels, particularly progressive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:24.960
individuals, although in 2020, Joe Biden did&nbsp;
seem more support from within the military than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:31.440
Democratic presidents have seen for a long time.&nbsp;
But this issue of militancy and white supremacy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:37.760
and racism within law enforcement has been studied&nbsp;
for a long time by the Brennan Center for Justice.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:45.040
And it is important to understand that it is a&nbsp;
widely known issue and that while, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:52.080
most I've said before, this is not an antique&nbsp;
cop show or an antimilitary show in terms of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:57.440
the individuals, I continue to believe and&nbsp;
this is based on both everything I've read&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:03.120
empirically and my personal experience, most&nbsp;
police officers become police officers for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:09.280
right reasons. Most people who join the military&nbsp;
join the military not to go out and kill people in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:15.600
cold blood or or they do join for what they see&nbsp;
as doing something good for their community or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:21.840
their country. The unfortunate reality is that&nbsp;
law enforcement and the military also attract&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:30.640
disproportionately culturally conservative people,&nbsp;
disproportionately folks motivated more by fear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:38.320
and and possibly anger, disproportionately more&nbsp;
people, too. And I hate to say it be sympathetic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.400
to the ideas of far right militancy. Now,&nbsp;
that doesn't mean that it's the majority.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:48.320
It's not. But relative to the population, they&nbsp;
are overrepresented. And so that's something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:54.480
that has to be dealt with. Law enforcement&nbsp;
and the military have tried different ideas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.800
and so far it has not worked particularly well.&nbsp;
And it remains a, quote, persistent threat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:08.480
according to the FBI. So the point here is it&nbsp;
shouldn't be a surprise that this is a concern,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:13.360
even including the National Guard troops that&nbsp;
will be supposedly securing Washington, D.C. for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:20.080
the inauguration of Joe Biden. I'm hopeful, but&nbsp;
unsure if this late stage vetting that the FBI&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:27.680
is doing will be enough. But my hope is&nbsp;
that even if some individuals slip through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:34.480
who are sympathetic to some of the goals of the&nbsp;
rioters and would be rioters, that they will be so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:40.480
few and far between among the twenty five thousand&nbsp;
National Guard troops that it will not really lead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:46.240
to an opportunity for anybody to do anything that&nbsp;
even resembles what we saw on January 6th. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:52.160
my hope, and I hope it doesn't end up being a&nbsp;
naive hope. But we will be watching it as we will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:57.840
be covering Joe Biden's inauguration tomorrow.&nbsp;
And I hope you will join me. We will be live&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:06.000
on YouTube, Twitch and Facebook starting at 11:00&nbsp;
a.m. Eastern Time, 8:00 a.m. Pacific Time. We will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:11.920
start an hour before we will see the gathering in&nbsp;
Washington, D.C., the swearing in of Joe Biden as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:18.160
president, the swearing in of Kamala Harris, vice&nbsp;
president. And then we will have a changing of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:23.040
guard. We will officially have it. Trump will be&nbsp;
out, Biden will be in, and we will go right into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:28.720
demanding that Joe Biden do the things he promised&nbsp;
to do on day one. I'll give him until day two.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:36.080
I'll be honest, all I think day, literally day one&nbsp;
is tough. But maybe the first full day, I expect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:40.400
executive orders from Joe Biden on Thursday,&nbsp;
and we will be here with you for everything.&nbsp;

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.840
So we'll see you for that tomorrow.&nbsp;
We have a great show today. Let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:46.560
me know if you'll be watching.
